---
mm: 1.2
kind: module
name: fonts
module: mm.fonts
use: mm.display
use: mm.gfx
file: types.cppm mm.fonts:types
file: renderer.cppm mm.fonts:renderer
file: data.cppm mm.fonts:data
file: fonts.cppm mm.fonts
file: src/renderer.cpp
---

Bitmap font support for the one-bit ePaper and the sixteen-bit RGB565 LCD
panels. Generated glyph tables (derived from IBM Plex Mono, SIL OFL 1.1, see
licenses/OFL.txt) and a transparent one-bit compositor above mm.display:
measure and render. Packed row expansion and rotation are in mm.gfx.

The tables are produced by tools/fonts/gen_font.py on the development host.
data.cppm is generated and must not be edited by hand; regenerate it from the
pinned TTF when the charset or the sizes change.
